WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.650
At Khartoum, in Sudan, the
Blue and White Niles meet.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.230
South of the city, between
the rivers, lies the Gezira:

3
00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.760
hot and semi-arid.

4
00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:14.970
Wad Medani gets 354
millimetres of rain a year.

5
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:18.710
It began in 1911, with
an experimental farm.

6
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:25.390
It grew into one of the largest irrigation
projects in Africa: 880,000 hectares.

7
00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:29.710
About 100,000 tenant households
farm it, growing cotton,

8
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.290
wheat and sorghum.

9
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.130
So what went wrong next?

10
00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:34.630
Did the river run dry?

11
00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.130
Did pests strike?

12
00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.650
In this mission, you'll see why
this plain needs river water,

13
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.090
and what irrigation brings.

14
00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:44.230
Then you'll diagnose the
problems that followed,

15
00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.330
and judge the fixes.

16
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:49.290
Your mission: find out what
went wrong in the Gezira,

17
00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.230
and how it could be fixed.
